{"title": "Multiattack: Prone Restrained or Maimed", "pageid": 23039, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Multiattack:_Prone_Restrained_or_Maimed", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp, /w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp/300px-Generic_Multiattack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7c/Generic_Multiattack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Multiattack: Prone, Restrained, or Maimed</b> is a passive feature of the <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a> that lets them attack a target multiple times if they have the Prone, Restrained, or Maimed conditions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This Steel Watcher can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Multiattack (Steel Watcher Titan)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/38px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/50px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Multiattack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp/25px-Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/32/Multiattack_Earth_Elemental_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Multiattack (Steel Watcher Titan)\">Multiattack</a> any <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Prone\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8e/Prone_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">Prone</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Maimed_(Condition)\" title=\"Maimed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Maimed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/51/Crippled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Maimed_(Condition)\" title=\"Maimed (Condition)\">Maimed</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Restrained\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Restrained_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Restrained_(Condition)\" title=\"Restrained (Condition)\">Restrained</a> creature. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Can <a href=\"/wiki/Multiattack_(Steel_Watcher_Titan)\" title=\"Multiattack (Steel Watcher Titan)\">multiattack</a> any <a href=\"/wiki/Prone_(Condition)\" title=\"Prone (Condition)\">prone</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Maimed_(Condition)\" title=\"Maimed (Condition)\">maimed</a>, or <a href=\"/wiki/Restrain